  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "初冬，我走在清涼的街道上，遇見了我的弟弟。",
      "output_sha256": "ce50ff92d0cdb20f58e00c67f60292c92e8d9fb63507fbce7d9a7f321ee7fdd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce50ff92d0cdb20f58e00c67f60292c92e8d9fb63507fbce7d9a7f321ee7fdd5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“瑩姐，你走到哪裏去？”",
      "output_sha256": "a8a601a22e6d376b8986cc460dec942285f51b2e4bfa1cfe97100d530c5fd432",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8a601a22e6d376b8986cc460dec942285f51b2e4bfa1cfe97100d530c5fd432",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“隨便走走吧！”",
      "output_sha256": "c6c2f582e7416c1defd42795cd025bb82c53af43258d061a499b99758dea77d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6c2f582e7416c1defd42795cd025bb82c53af43258d061a499b99758dea77d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我們去吃一杯咖啡，好不好，瑩姐。”",
      "output_sha256": "ed7df36acd2e99d80e56df064f238dafa0b48a66b60e0d563fb3b3132e900c7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "ed7df36acd2e99d80e56df064f238dafa0b48a66b60e0d563fb3b3132e900c7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "咖啡店的窗子在簾幕下掛着蒼白的霜層。",
      "output_sha256": "92f4d3c1139156c97dd36ab30c65efb287bfe4dac0833a586d731c2930d78659",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "92f4d3c1139156c97dd36ab30c65efb287bfe4dac0833a586d731c2930d78659",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我把領口脫着毛的外衣搭在衣架上。",
      "output_sha256": "dfa30c0182762eb605f9a55a8be33a447d5096680db0cf7f2ce9e596d239f255",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfa30c0182762eb605f9a55a8be33a447d5096680db0cf7f2ce9e596d239f255",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們開始攪動杯子，發出鈴響般的聲音。",
      "output_sha256": "d94cd9ba7bc87cd6ca3abf0266096453f688a0f8b3763dbe9f81c44dd6c68238",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.534992,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d8f25f5cd3222a6a8da73bb8816fd08295bf2c4eb79d95f71226760be4a7c5b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d94cd9ba7bc87cd6ca3abf0266096453f688a0f8b3763dbe9f81c44dd6c68238",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“天冷了吧！",
      "output_sha256": "0fdbf758f5cf2507ca57e50eb3b644116d5824904dc0cea5c2c45cb8528080da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "0fdbf758f5cf2507ca57e50eb3b644116d5824904dc0cea5c2c45cb8528080da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "並且也太孤寂了，你還是回家的好。”",
      "output_sha256": "f06693a9efbb1b307d09ea0ce7fb11576c334747d8b00aaa7e47221e14582ee4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "f06693a9efbb1b307d09ea0ce7fb11576c334747d8b00aaa7e47221e14582ee4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "弟弟的眼睛如深邃的夜空。",
      "output_sha256": "ba5ee14e15cea6c1ebc98deaf32ac477a5117160c438b46b55ffc1cd2fb289bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.586818,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6fb458e7fdf38d47f8a6c3eab5ab4a4b583a449de65aaa7496b2769f48f8be5c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba5ee14e15cea6c1ebc98deaf32ac477a5117160c438b46b55ffc1cd2fb289bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我搖了頭，我說：“你們學校的籃球隊近來怎麼樣？",
      "output_sha256": "354dbcbe72e87bdc7f9c15da63dc5f30433f30fc8c49582132a31eb2367e7e35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "354dbcbe72e87bdc7f9c15da63dc5f30433f30fc8c49582132a31eb2367e7e35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "還活躍嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "317db26a0a8121df232245a3840f7be4b817784e29db2c485683b5c352a05427",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "317db26a0a8121df232245a3840f7be4b817784e29db2c485683b5c352a05427",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你還是那麼熱情嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "15c014a430ac75571936180102c8195a17de326d0835a9aa27897cfa3cb819a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.459416,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "08b831279fc1b3d200356c0ec5ac32f4e3255999eb87cf287acb0cd156d7d281"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "15c014a430ac75571936180102c8195a17de326d0835a9aa27897cfa3cb819a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我擲筐擲得更進步，可惜你總也沒到我們球場上來了。",
      "output_sha256": "0f8b99f0b5af0c14bf2d2bfb04be2e88ad0c6335d7824c3fa27495796d066bc2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f8b99f0b5af0c14bf2d2bfb04be2e88ad0c6335d7824c3fa27495796d066bc2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這樣不快樂可不行。”",
      "output_sha256": "16ec6ac5cb8944ff534437580b03bed402b31c3727a389787c4b1ba7f7b4bff6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.554231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4b2b7bc80bb51865685df60716891b55544bc784f072657e0009fd77cd03fe1b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "16ec6ac5cb8944ff534437580b03bed402b31c3727a389787c4b1ba7f7b4bff6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我依然在攪動杯子，或許我的心情就像那漂流的海水，若非遭遇猛烈的風暴，便不會激起波濤。",
      "output_sha256": "ac048a12803e78934c388374f8e9cdce399caff9bf169c2758fc78a2e45f5ae3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.48466,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c3eb6f9f6ae495aa469e27840c0bd01f0e0f71965cd7c6b227ac49301ec49974"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac048a12803e78934c388374f8e9cdce399caff9bf169c2758fc78a2e45f5ae3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我開始弄着手帕。",
      "output_sha256": "52782c52bc04e69c1b9794e4035056f39b34832957a7c5601f6468f04a2468e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "52782c52bc04e69c1b9794e4035056f39b34832957a7c5601f6468f04a2468e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "弟弟再向我說什麼我已不去聽清他，彷彿自己是沉墜在深遠的幻想的井裏。",
      "output_sha256": "cebacdb2ace1cbdb83654b3b770bda4af84c2d38feb6530cf607d0d63787f12e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "cebacdb2ace1cbdb83654b3b770bda4af84c2d38feb6530cf607d0d63787f12e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我不記得咖啡是如何被我喝光的。",
      "output_sha256": "f032dde2de15c373c9c3df98ea600bbf78b25299da241267c80054b6558023e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.545657,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d807a9c3092f743199ee4626f0c3027f5414e63adedc8559d22fbf762b984fe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f032dde2de15c373c9c3df98ea600bbf78b25299da241267c80054b6558023e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "茶匙在攪着空的杯子時，弟弟說：“再來一杯吧！”",
      "output_sha256": "a5d0ee0ff6d00c90071541aaace3b6f563efd714419a084241ab51011df3e631",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5d0ee0ff6d00c90071541aaace3b6f563efd714419a084241ab51011df3e631",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "女侍者帶着歡笑一般飛起的頭髮來到我們桌邊，她又用很響亮的腳步搖搖地走了去。",
      "output_sha256": "2ef66eefecc55164419fd5d135d16ebf6f34b4e9096afd8bd7428c37b256c3cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ef66eefecc55164419fd5d135d16ebf6f34b4e9096afd8bd7428c37b256c3cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "或許是因為清晨的寒冷，咖啡店內再無其他顧客。",
      "output_sha256": "2d66d5504a94d0879fb051d23edc3cc3d295148dc7ac8ef4a791b279ada6d7a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.393681,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "54709fc45419b514bf9160b1f5ef8d66a76c5135460464901fed26d8ad42ddd4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d66d5504a94d0879fb051d23edc3cc3d295148dc7ac8ef4a791b279ada6d7a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在弟弟默默注視我的時候，我的思緒如同玻璃般寧靜，甚至能聽到壁間暖氣管微微的嘶鳴聲。",
      "output_sha256": "336917d7e7de35d983d2f38f072fb643739656a149ccdb555cbbbe0e3cca9cd7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.517908,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b976ccfaf422053494237ae3d1e892cb04afbf9cdea032da9fb919b15fbf974e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "336917d7e7de35d983d2f38f072fb643739656a149ccdb555cbbbe0e3cca9cd7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“天冷了，還是回家好，心情這樣不暢快，長久了是無益的。”",
      "output_sha256": "887208a740b869d5cdc7382d2bbe80cdbfa7a2222ff10193e7d3209dec11ffb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "887208a740b869d5cdc7382d2bbe80cdbfa7a2222ff10193e7d3209dec11ffb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“怎麼！”",
      "output_sha256": "5848f1443020245ff8c2a4e56f7bba5d59a6f481eb2e930def7b90cadce2fb89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "5848f1443020245ff8c2a4e56f7bba5d59a6f481eb2e930def7b90cadce2fb89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“壞情緒對你有什麼好處？”",
      "output_sha256": "3b9893ff2fc4cc4940609ec748227af914f92e39a492fb245991b9d9ecacdfaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.58564,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7e38234dcdab1ba9df7cb8b14d507705ca59eecc75ef3514a9ecd3561ba5e9ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3b9893ff2fc4cc4940609ec748227af914f92e39a492fb245991b9d9ecacdfaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“爲什麼要說我的心情不好呢？”",
      "output_sha256": "e5b0f9afce3717051890bfcd369bec606535d4ae6dbdb9fe39d3c0729e143cba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "e5b0f9afce3717051890bfcd369bec606535d4ae6dbdb9fe39d3c0729e143cba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們又開始攪動杯子。",
      "output_sha256": "68c24fa631be564625ba1c049eab74797538803b0ae801e430bfb5ffc0404f9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.595425,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a14827f6ca2a74398f3a6265b21b75eb3bffc976182a8870b13c690cb273d112"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "68c24fa631be564625ba1c049eab74797538803b0ae801e430bfb5ffc0404f9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有外國人走進來，那響着嗓子的、嘴不住在說的女人，就坐在我們的近邊。",
      "output_sha256": "196a3a5c23fac1faa3141de38d875248af66d6857a4d3164f78f206b59439812",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "196a3a5c23fac1faa3141de38d875248af66d6857a4d3164f78f206b59439812",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她離得我越近，我越嗅到她滿衣的香氣，那使我感到她離得我更遼遠，也感到全人類離得我更遼遠。",
      "output_sha256": "b42da1a1df090a0d2aa8be7bee27e1a1b048e9df35e76abf8878f008175729f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "b42da1a1df090a0d2aa8be7bee27e1a1b048e9df35e76abf8878f008175729f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "也許她那安然自得的姿態與我毫無關聯。",
      "output_sha256": "5b114be0fc6c4b012a6cc5207635d66bd68a0c4683ec42c74281dd152425c8b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.472134,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d2a773a3702a9fda36059121615f56ca902f5bef43db6e91d128d87cec313f0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5b114be0fc6c4b012a6cc5207635d66bd68a0c4683ec42c74281dd152425c8b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們繼續攪著杯子，再也無法像之前那樣發出響聲。",
      "output_sha256": "7e6939e51002c752cd830b1ba5d4a3afc7c08f1fcd9bc798f1bb9b58e7fd56de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.398691,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dfdb1f4b92779c85a952c8df31e5aa910b157565a09a64bf86da4ce289018361"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7e6939e51002c752cd830b1ba5d4a3afc7c08f1fcd9bc798f1bb9b58e7fd56de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "街上的車輛似乎漸漸增多，窗外的人影快速而繁雜地晃動。",
      "output_sha256": "cb4f2f55f93bd24348fd50f1577796b2bae94d480e1dd53080b445e6e126ea6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.473994,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "69c54f819b0db2503c96709e7569845a692fe2176ad6b62f1791013b3cc4b40b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cb4f2f55f93bd24348fd50f1577796b2bae94d480e1dd53080b445e6e126ea6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "隔着窗子，可以聽到喑啞的笑聲和喑啞的踏在行人道上的鞋子的聲音。",
      "output_sha256": "d332680a6ab699856d45a5f6e73aabbf792a8d9aa30123d1a64e8fa27fb07e15",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "d332680a6ab699856d45a5f6e73aabbf792a8d9aa30123d1a64e8fa27fb07e15",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“瑩姐，”弟弟的眼睛是深黑色的。",
      "output_sha256": "c83401cb5c4559aa0a19440f1ef2674a4b4ee5f820388b7c7c3089e89752983c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "c83401cb5c4559aa0a19440f1ef2674a4b4ee5f820388b7c7c3089e89752983c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“天冷了，再不能飄流下去，回家去吧！”",
      "output_sha256": "831f6daf7a8669784a6aa27b6d5b3e8a0c1d7f94ad31dc916a5c30db791cb203",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "831f6daf7a8669784a6aa27b6d5b3e8a0c1d7f94ad31dc916a5c30db791cb203",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "弟弟說：“你的頭髮這樣長了，怎麼不到理髮店去一次呢？”",
      "output_sha256": "fd8326d62abbb07bbb5b8e177398abfa2c5ab3aeb6a5d91468440c925e52a64b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd8326d62abbb07bbb5b8e177398abfa2c5ab3aeb6a5d91468440c925e52a64b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我不知為何，聽到這話感到一陣激動。",
      "output_sha256": "7e45d960ef172391fef24e3a82e5bfac3a62d096a5690eb75d1c6e4695d59ca6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.485,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c70aa8c9e6c13974eaf2a414ac09976c1ec6b6fea6bc9f2e5a6f91e1990c904a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7e45d960ef172391fef24e3a82e5bfac3a62d096a5690eb75d1c6e4695d59ca6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也許要熄滅的燈火在我心中復燃起來，熱力和光明鼓盪着我：",
      "output_sha256": "d159325927d36ae4a7964f7e502af342f882c6938af42b6d74bbb467337b15b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "d159325927d36ae4a7964f7e502af342f882c6938af42b6d74bbb467337b15b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那樣的家我是不想回去的。”",
      "output_sha256": "038719efe5d1c7e3488405f5a94173c069158e7a4fe3ee318e58b828ba79c856",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "038719efe5d1c7e3488405f5a94173c069158e7a4fe3ee318e58b828ba79c856",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那麼飄流着，就這樣飄流着？”",
      "output_sha256": "477ee6ebcd6ae0fe7a1f168ce8c81d7013c5d30a6090e31b6f3a832d7a26dddd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "477ee6ebcd6ae0fe7a1f168ce8c81d7013c5d30a6090e31b6f3a832d7a26dddd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "弟弟的眼睛是深黑色的。",
      "output_sha256": "6fb458e7fdf38d47f8a6c3eab5ab4a4b583a449de65aaa7496b2769f48f8be5c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "6fb458e7fdf38d47f8a6c3eab5ab4a4b583a449de65aaa7496b2769f48f8be5c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的杯子留在左手裏邊，另一隻手在桌面上，手心向上翻張了開來，要在空間摸索着什麼似的。",
      "output_sha256": "5769dec7f17bb518b9ad6231b14c469e7fee8c3a2d3b131421b2f3847d422059",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "5769dec7f17bb518b9ad6231b14c469e7fee8c3a2d3b131421b2f3847d422059",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "最終，他抓住了自己的圍巾。",
      "output_sha256": "17bdf48ec72160b08e7e15b7be113f29fa5f0a647eb8e8191a2a9e560c3f6c92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.544697,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "15d60edecefe14716b54957d1ba5252549e27321da05c40071b5f6515efa0b7e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "17bdf48ec72160b08e7e15b7be113f29fa5f0a647eb8e8191a2a9e560c3f6c92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我看著他微微顫抖的嘴唇：“瑩姐，我真的很擔心你這個女流浪者！”",
      "output_sha256": "abe541722575720ddbd9696a28e2f490ab54aeeab5ce453386920457a32cd928",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.596314,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "73f8f420e6ac43cc8b2266b5f1b148c36a9be8fc4d5c0735bdabd7a74dbe515b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "abe541722575720ddbd9696a28e2f490ab54aeeab5ce453386920457a32cd928",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他牙齒好像更白了些，更大些，而且有力了，而且充滿熱情了。",
      "output_sha256": "211574e8a5eabd8075b0b7dd282a318c4b4881a6f19d9111ae3b8cc02e5334db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "211574e8a5eabd8075b0b7dd282a318c4b4881a6f19d9111ae3b8cc02e5334db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "爲熱情而波動，他的嘴脣是那樣的退去了顏色。",
      "output_sha256": "0f956858e8d96fea3e025abf2b84a8111a8fd99edc35251e2e6ae7c36a617e27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f956858e8d96fea3e025abf2b84a8111a8fd99edc35251e2e6ae7c36a617e27",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "並且他的全人有些近乎狂人，然而安靜，完全被熱情侵佔着。",
      "output_sha256": "d535e35666e73fcde0aa8014b8c288a2b5f2ede96c36abb70504939ccff6f51f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "d535e35666e73fcde0aa8014b8c288a2b5f2ede96c36abb70504939ccff6f51f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "出了咖啡店，我們在結着薄碎的冰雪上面踏着腳。",
      "output_sha256": "a9f8aeeff01199649071bf522a596d370f1b7f718e424bb981f86382a2c41634",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9f8aeeff01199649071bf522a596d370f1b7f718e424bb981f86382a2c41634",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "初冬，早晨的紅日撲着我們的頭髮，這樣的紅光使我感到欣快和寂寞。",
      "output_sha256": "548e78df9fe5f276ae6bfb3dcb565d669870358cc930b83eaf36e180d353ee4e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "548e78df9fe5f276ae6bfb3dcb565d669870358cc930b83eaf36e180d353ee4e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "弟弟不住地在手下搖着帽子，肩頭聳起了又落下了；心臟也是高了又低了。",
      "output_sha256": "e4236b776278ffea9d012f43cfa44871d4e02beef8e3949a5859b68e640ca1cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4236b776278ffea9d012f43cfa44871d4e02beef8e3949a5859b68e640ca1cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "微小的同情者與被同情者逐漸離開了街道。",
      "output_sha256": "3c0be2716fa80622948bea074f30e75af61528930dd56233edb6d7f0fbd1c531",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.646895,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "142ed55bd3f6042a8e5f027b7e5bf1978c657f2e0375f3cc35ecb2bf72ae28fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3c0be2716fa80622948bea074f30e75af61528930dd56233edb6d7f0fbd1c531",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "停在一個荒敗的棗樹園的前面時，他突然把很厚的手伸給了我，這是我們要告別了。",
      "output_sha256": "e791fea8a285346444d3aed8b821daa99defc2cb3212f45cdeb3d81c1e236618",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "e791fea8a285346444d3aed8b821daa99defc2cb3212f45cdeb3d81c1e236618",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我要去上課了！”",
      "output_sha256": "64833c1987d1a19b8545aa0b8318369399bc033b03a666f0e522cd2267401e63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.540018,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "78b13f89585e7e822ab64dca2fe70e89c95ec36739f7a9d3bd3effe927de33f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "64833c1987d1a19b8545aa0b8318369399bc033b03a666f0e522cd2267401e63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他放開我的手，背過身去，卻走了幾步又轉回來：",
      "output_sha256": "a80c6d52b12eec1f9306f9321bff5633e145a693178915a5808cc8eb1d7a83af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.552812,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55,
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "152098b30ef9ebaedaffcda2f21fe9865dee50bb07dbe730852f3267879254eb",
        "bead13c5c1472b2a6cca9365755ca6ea9322c627cf076e1f4c8665ebaa096844"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a80c6d52b12eec1f9306f9321bff5633e145a693178915a5808cc8eb1d7a83af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“瑩姐，我看你還是回家的好！”",
      "output_sha256": "de5d65a71dc73952865ab24c0a70b3002382139f8fa5381bdd547e2f94f56f1b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "de5d65a71dc73952865ab24c0a70b3002382139f8fa5381bdd547e2f94f56f1b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那樣的家我是不能回去的，我不願意受和我站在兩極端的父親的豢養……”",
      "output_sha256": "fbb433a85ef0777f5185b7e3d88ad92df12245dac5570b98d83833f8e02b5735",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "fbb433a85ef0777f5185b7e3d88ad92df12245dac5570b98d83833f8e02b5735",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那麼你要錢用嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "6b46b88c52aeb949b9e95caf89f212062912c0ca26441e5bbb9ab4d55c73d410",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "6b46b88c52aeb949b9e95caf89f212062912c0ca26441e5bbb9ab4d55c73d410",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“不要的。”",
      "output_sha256": "1ecbeb66632962d069bb3cfea680568e10d858b3d734a7ba1ea92a8154bd36cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ecbeb66632962d069bb3cfea680568e10d858b3d734a7ba1ea92a8154bd36cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“那麼，你就這樣過下去嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "aa25fec99b17bd93d8c28cb153b444ca7f7bd419b4dbfdb9a444a4a9ba333338",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.628887,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "94ffe83aef7e1bdd0807bda611be6aef68c7fa929f1b0d368e27ee76119aeead"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa25fec99b17bd93d8c28cb153b444ca7f7bd419b4dbfdb9a444a4a9ba333338",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你瘦了！",
      "output_sha256": "c6de60b1a7865e681c0153a41dd2a0061746a9dac268d258b48fac6dc9764e8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6de60b1a7865e681c0153a41dd2a0061746a9dac268d258b48fac6dc9764e8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你快要生病了！",
      "output_sha256": "248e7b2a6793cb844ccc3912e91b859302c399c792f265b58d9331c22553edb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "248e7b2a6793cb844ccc3912e91b859302c399c792f265b58d9331c22553edb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你的衣服也太薄了！”",
      "output_sha256": "05540dd06a19934383b25b208ee1be70e79fb2c7543b2d9e9fa4e9037051de67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.84375,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
